stdlib + guard + custom wrapper type: os.ReadFile's error is replaced by NotFoundError[AccountID] when it is
fs.ErrNotExist, otherwise wrapped "filerepo: read %s: %w"; decode errors are wrapped in &CorruptError{Err: err}.
Expect concrete NotFoundError[AccountID], ReadFile errors behind the errorf, and errShortRecord /
strconv.ErrSyntax / strconv.ErrRange behind (*CorruptError).Unwrap (strconv ones also behind "balance: %w" or "status: %w").
